# The FIXED workflow YAML is committed next to this file:  .setup/android-build.yml
#
# GitHub will not let the Arena coding agent write to .github/workflows/** , so
# apply it yourself (one of these):
#
# A) Grant the permission, then ask the agent to push it:
#      https://github.com/settings/installations  ->  Arena AI Coding Agent  ->
#      Configure  ->  Repository permissions  ->  Workflows  ->  Read and write
#
# B) Paste it in the web editor:
#      https://github.com/chrstianjames/laughing-couscous/edit/main/.github/workflows/android-build.yml
#    select all -> delete -> paste the contents of .setup/android-build.yml -> Commit to main
#
